OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening with
OL,7,Fincreasing bright then clear spells.
OL,8,FStaying dry overnight with some clear
OL,9,Fspells but high cloud gradually
OL,10,Fspilling east towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA dry and quite bright start
OL,13,Fbut soon clouding over in the morning
OL,14,Fwith the odd spot of rain.
OL,15,FIncreasingly windy in the afternoon.
OL,16,FRain spreads east through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
