OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand patchy rain clearing east on
OL,7,FFriday morning. Then bright spells and
OL,8,Fa few showers on Friday and Saturday.
OL,9,FShowery rain spreads east on Sunday.
